<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You’re a rookie Trainer, aren’t you?\nI can tell!\rThat’s OK! Everyone is a rookie\nat some point!\rIf you’d like, I can teach you a\nfew things.\fOK, then! Follow me!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ohh... I’m sorry.\nI forgot that you weren’t wearing the\fRunning Shoes!\rI’ll try to go as slow as possible, so\ntry keeping up!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">This is a Pokémon Center. They heal\nyour Pokémon in no time at all.\rYou’ll be relying on them a lot, so\nyou better learn about them.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">This is a Pokémon Mart.\nThey sell Poké Balls for catching wild\fPokémon and other useful items.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Route 30 is out this way.\rTrainers will be battling their\nPokémon there.\rIf you go a little farther,\nyou’ll see Mr. Pokémon’s House.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">This is the sea, as you can see.\rSome Pokémon are found only in water.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Here...\nIt’s my house!\rFor your effort keeping up with me,\nI’ll give you my Running Shoes!\fThey’re still warm!\r...\n...\rGot you, didn’t I?\nDon’t worry, these are brand new!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} received\nthe Running Shoes from the Guide Gent!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The instructions read,\n“Touch the Sprint Button on the\fTouch Screen to sprint.”\rIt also says,\n“Hold the B Button down to sprint.”\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">...Hffp... Hffp...\nI made it...\rI forgot about one thing.\nThis is another token from me!\rTake it.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Guide Gent loaded the Map Card\non {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}’s Pokégear!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}’s Pokégear\ncan now show the Town Map!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Select the Pokégear on the\nTouch Screen and then select\fthe Town Map icon.\rYou’ll see the map of the region\nyou’re currently in!\rThe Pokégear becomes more useful as\nyou add Cards.\rI wish you luck on your journey!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">...\rYou got a Pokémon at the Lab.\nWhat a waste.\rThat’s a Pokémon that’s too good for\na wimp like you.\r...\nDon’t you get what I’m saying?\rWell, I too have a good Pokémon.\nI’ll show you what I mean!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">...\rDo you want to know who I am?\n...\rI’m going to be the world’s greatest\nPokémon Trainer.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00015" index="15">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Give it back!\nThat’s my Trainer Card!\rOh no!\nYou saw my name...\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00016" index="16">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Did you talk to the old man by the\nPokémon Center?\rHe’ll put a Map of Johto on your\nPokégear.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00017" index="17">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">These boats don’t go far anymore.\rUsed to be you could ride the coast\nclear to Olivine.\rNow they mostly just... sit. Rocking\nwith the tide, going nowhere.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00018" index="18">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Mr. Pokémon’s house is still farther\nup ahead.\rYou could use the Running Shoes if\nyou had a pair.\rBut beware of wild Pokémon and\nTrainers!\rWhen you run, the noise will\nattract them.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00019" index="19">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Did you SEE him? The CHAMPION, right\nhere in Cherrygrove!\rOne day I’m gonna fly off into the\nclouds just like that. You’ll see.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00020" index="20">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Champion or not, Silver still drops in\nto lose to Gold now and then.\rDoes the old man good. Don’t tell Gold\nI said he won.\f...Say. A Pokémon I hooked off the pier\nwas holding this. Mystic Water, I\nthink. No use to me - you want it?\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00021" index="21">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Back to fishing for me, then.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00022" index="22">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You don’t have room for this.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00023" index="23">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">CHERRYGROVE CITY\n“Where the cherry trees and the sea\nlook after their own.”</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00024" index="24">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">There’s no plaque here.\rJust a quiet house, a worn battle ring\nin the yard, and a man who’s done\nenough.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00025" index="25">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Heh. Didn’t expect a crowd.\nSilver never learned to lose well.\rYour friend ran on up to the route -\ngo catch up with her.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00026" index="26">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">GOLD: TYPHLOSION! Fire Blast, now!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00027" index="27">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">SILVER: Alakazam. Psychic.\rEnd it.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00028" index="28">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">SILVER: ...And that’s the match.\rYour TYPHLOSION still hits like a\nfreight train, old man.\rBut your reads have gone soft.\rHalf a step behind me the whole way.\rRetirement’s made you rusty, Gold.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00029" index="29">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">GOLD: Hah! No sense denying it.\rThat’s the first real battle I’ve had\nin years.\rFelt good. Felt like the old days.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00030" index="30">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">SILVER: You could have the old days\nback any time you wanted.\rCome back to the League.\rThe circuit’s grown dull with no one\nleft worth fearing.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00031" index="31">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">GOLD: And upstage the Champion in\nfront of the whole world?\rNot a chance.\r...Besides. Everything I need is\nright here in this quiet little town.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00032" index="32">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">SILVER: ...Heh. Same old Gold.\rTake care of yourself.\rI’ve got a region waiting on me.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00033" index="33">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">KESTRA: No way. No way, no way -\rThat’s Champion Silver. Here.\nIn the flesh.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00034" index="34">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">KESTRA: Did you SEE that?!\r...Hey. I don’t know you, and I know\neverybody round here.\rYou must’ve just got in. Some first\nday, huh?\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00035" index="35">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">KESTRA: That’s gonna be me one day.\rThe whole world stopping just to\nwatch.\rYou’ll see.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00036" index="36">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">KESTRA: ...And he just flies off. Like\nthe sky belongs to him.\rAnyway - welcome to the neighborhood,\nstranger.\rTry to keep up. Things are about to\nget interesting.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00037" index="37">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">KESTRA: Whoa - hold up, hold up!\rYou can’t just walk into the tall\ngrass with no Pokémon of your own.\rThe wild ones out there won’t care\nhow new you are.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00038" index="38">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">KESTRA: ...You really don’t have one\nyet, do you. New kid, for real.\rLucky for you - I know exactly where\nto fix that.\rCome on. This way!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00039" index="39">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">KESTRA: There you are, slowpoke!\rLook at this place - real tall grass,\nreal wild Pokémon, just waiting.\rI’ve been creeping around trying not\nto spook ’em -\f...Wait. Wait wait wait. THERE’S one!\rCome on, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} - let’s\nget him!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00040" index="40">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">GOLD: Whoa - HOLD it, you two! You\ndon’t go charging a wild Pokémon\nwith none of your own.\r...And now it’s spotted you. Of\ncourse it has.\fStand back, both of you.\rLet me show you how this is done.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00041" index="41">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">GOLD: ...And - gotcha.\rHeh. Still got the touch.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00042" index="42">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">GOLD: Phew. That was close.\rYou kids can’t go running off into\ntall grass like that!\rWhat to do with you two... *sigh*\fAlright. Come with me.\rGuess it’s my job to show you the\nropes, now that the old man’s gone.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00043" index="43">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">GOLD: Alright, uh... that’s the tour.\rYou should, uh, go play at home now.\nOr something.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00044" index="44">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">KESTRA: Aren’t you going to give us our\nvery first Pokémon now?!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00045" index="45">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">GOLD: Uh...\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00046" index="46">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">KESTRA: Come onnnn! That’s what\nChampions doooo, right?\rRight, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}?!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00047" index="47">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">GOLD: Well, uh... I mean, I suppose\nso...\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00048" index="48">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">KESTRA: Yaaaay! My HERO!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00049" index="49">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">GOLD: Uh, ok. Wait right here.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00050" index="50">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">GOLD: Ok, here we go.\rThese three Pokémon are very special\nto me.\rYou can each pick one - but you have\nto promise to take really good care\nof them, ok?\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00051" index="51">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">KESTRA: Yaaaay! {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, you\ngo first!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00052" index="52">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} received the\n{STRVAR_1 0, 1, 0}!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00053" index="53">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">KESTRA: Then I’m taking THIS one!\rType advantage, right out of the gate.\nNothing personal.\r{STRVAR_1 0, 1, 0}, you’re with me!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00054" index="54">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">KESTRA: First stop: Professor Elm’s\nlab in New Bark!\rLast one there is a Slowpoke!\rSmell ya later,\n{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00055" index="55">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">GOLD: I rang Professor Elm--he’ll fix\nyou both up with a Pokédex.\rRoute 29, straight east. You should\nprobably go keep an eye on her...\rWelp. Typhlosion and I have some\ngardening to do.\rGood luck out there.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00056" index="56">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">ONLOOKER: That’s the CHAMPION! Right\nhere, in OUR town!\rI’m not blinking. Not gonna miss a\nsingle second of this.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00057" index="57">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">ONLOOKER: Ten years retired, and Gold\nstill makes the Champion sweat for it.\r...That’s our Gold. Heh.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00058" index="58">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">KESTRA: Okay, okay - where are my\nmanners.\rI’m Kestra. Born here, raised here. I\nknow every cobble in this town.\rAnd you - nope. Don’t know you. New\nface. I’d remember a new face.\fSo? What do I call you?\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00059" index="59">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">KESTRA: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\r{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}! Ha - good name.\rI’m gonna be hollering it across a\nwhole lot of battlefields, so it’s\nlucky it’s a good one.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00060" index="60">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">KESTRA: Me, I’ve wanted one thing since\nI could walk. ONE.\rTo be like him. Champion Silver. The\nbest there has ever been.\rYou just rolled in, so you wouldn’t\nknow - but everybody round here does.\fHe’s half the reason any of us ever\npicked up a Poké Ball.\rAnd he battled in MY town, on my first\nreal day. That has GOT to be a sign.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00061" index="61">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">KESTRA: Anyway - standing still is for\npeople who already made it, and that\nsure isn’t us. Yet!\rCome on, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}. The whole\nregion’s out THIS way.\rTry to keep up, partner!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00062" index="62">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">GOLD: And before you two go tearing\noff - here. You’ll want these.\rRunning Shoes, so I don’t have to watch\nyou amble off at a crawl.\rAnd a Map Card for your Pokégear, so\n“I got lost” stops being an excuse.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00063" index="63">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} received the\nRunning Shoes and the Map Card!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00064" index="64">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">GOLD: ...Right. The grand tour, since\nthe old man’s not here to give it.\rFirst stop. That’s the Pokémon\nCenter - it patches your Pokémon up,\nfree, every time.\fUse it more than you think you’ll\nneed to.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00065" index="65">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Whoa, did you SEE that battle?! That\nMurkrow was unbelievably fast!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00066" index="66">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Cherrygrove’s usually so quiet...\nA real battle right here! My heart’s\nstill pounding.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00067" index="67">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Heh, that youngster’s got some spark.\nReminds me of my own trainer days.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00068" index="68">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">GOLD: That road east is Route 29.\nIt runs to New Bark - Professor\nElm’s lab.\rLast calm stretch in Johto.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00069" index="69">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">KESTRA: I promise nothing.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00070" index="70">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">GOLD: The Poké Mart. Balls, Potions,\nRepels - it keeps you stocked.\rMoney goes fast out there. Spend it\non what keeps you standing.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00071" index="71">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">GOLD: And that... that’s the sea.\rIt’s pretty. It’s also deep. Stay\nout of it until something on your\nteam can swim.\r</language>
	</row>
</body>
